      "id": 1,
      "text": "Potomac was originally named Marysville after the wives of founders John Smith and Isaac Meneley, and was platted May 1 1869.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
